# P8: the Master Inserts page on the Mini. It has no Master key and no encoder: hold Menu, Right x3 is the Master box, each Mid steps its mode
# (Master, Mixer, Global Mixer, Inserts: interfaceMenuPopup.cpp masterModes), releasing Menu keeps the page. Down in the Insert 1 list is the picker.
# plus_flows.sh stages the card (/Plugins/Master/dirt.plg) and reads the slot afterwards: `inserts` must say 1=running:Dirt.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Master Inserts on the Mini (P8)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right x3
wait 300ms
tap Mid
wait 1200ms
tap Mid
wait 800ms
tap Mid
wait 800ms
tap Mid
wait 1200ms
release Menu
wait 1000ms
expect text "Inserts"
shot inserts-page
tap Down
wait 3000ms
expect text "Drive"
shot dirt-picked
